  m_GameObject: {fileID: 97622446}
  m_Text: 'HAMMER TUTORIAL

    Walk straight through: each room

    is a chapter
    of Valve''s Hammer

    docs, in order. Example builds at

    the end.

    Open
    Window > Hammer

    (Ctrl+Shift+H) and click anything.'
