    Step 2. Docs way: delete the

    deck''s covered
    faces, keep the

    arch''s inside faces

    (Shift+double-click a range,

    Ctrl+I
    invert, Delete), flip them

    (F), Bridge (B) the gaps, fill the

    ends
    (P). Or here: Boolean >

    Subtract.'
